# Scratch page renders from proofreading (pdftoppm over main.pdf). Regenerate on demand: committed
# they are megabytes that go stale on the next build, and 7 MB of them once shipped this way.
# figures/ is deliberately not covered: those PNGs are captures the thesis includes.
/_sheets/
/.chk/
/trimchk*
/chk.*
